+ * Whole days from a to b, counting UTC calendar dates and ignoring the time of day. Positive when b
+ * is later than a, negative when earlier. For example, 23:59 on one day and 00:01 the next is 1 day apart.
+ * @param {Date} a
+ * @param {Date} b
+ * @returns {number} an integer
+ * @throws {TypeError} when a or b is not a Date
+ * @throws {RangeError} when a or b is invalid
